2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Tetreau dit Ducharme was born on 17 October 1714, his father, Joseph Marie Tetreault, was 37 and his mother, Anne Jarret, was 33. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Angelique Benoit Livernois on 7 February 1735, in Verchères, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 21 July 1752, in Saint-Charles, Montreal, Canada, New France, at the age of 37, and was buried in Saint-Charles, Montreal, Canada, New France.
2 CONT
2 CONT
