1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L63V-42G
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Girard was born on 4 March 1732, in Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, his father, Pierre Girard, was 28 and his mother, Marie Thérèse Tétreau, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Françoise Doré on 2 February 1761, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Verchères, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada in 1732. He died on 26 February 1803, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 70, and was buried in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada.
