2 GIVN Joseph
2 SURN Tétreault dit Ducharme
2 _MARNM Tétreault dit Ducharme
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1 NOV 1735
1 DEAT
2 DATE 27 APR 1796
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/MJK7-Y68
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Tetreau dit Ducharme was born in October 1735, in Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, his father, Joseph Tetreault, was 25 and his mother, Charlotte Guertin, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Françoise Fontaine Bienvenue on 8 November 1756, in Saint-Charles-sur-Richelieu, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Marie Francoise in 1757, he married 2nd wife Marie Louise-Amable Corbeil (1739–1781)
2 CONT on 16 January 1758 in Saint-Antoine-sur-Richelieu, Richelieu, Quebec, Canada
2 CONT They had 10 children
2 CONT Simon Tetreau 1758–1803
2 CONT Joseph Tetreau Ducharme 1760–1820
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Tetrault or Ducharme 1762–1837
2 CONT Jeanne Christine Tetreau 1764–
2 CONT Marie Anne Tetreau 1764–
2 CONT Charlotte Tetreau 1767–1794
2 CONT Marguerite Tetreau Ducharme 1771–
2 CONT Gabriel Tetreau 1773–
2 CONT Marie Louise Tetreau 1777–
2 CONT Josephte Tetreau 1778–1820
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 27 April 1796, in Saint-Charles-sur-Richelieu, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 60, and was buried in Saint-Charles-sur-Richelieu, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
