1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/MJLN-N5R
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph Amable'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Amable Brodeur was born on 2 October 1745, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jean  Marie Brodeur, was 42 and his mother, Anne Tetreault, was 35. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Louise Marguerite Ayet Malo on 7 February 1785, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 1 daughter. 
2 CONT Hippolyte Brodeur 1786–1860
2 CONT Louise Brodeur 1788–1852
2 CONT Francois Brodeur 1790–1790
2 CONT Antoine Brodeur 1790–
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 2 May 1790, in his hometown, at the age of 44, and was buried in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada.
