1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LJSS-KPL
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Marguerite'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Marguerite Tetreau was born on 26 December 1752, in Saint-Charles, Montreal, Quebec, British North America, her father, Jean Baptiste Tetreau dit Ducharme, was 38 and her mother, Marie Angelique Benoit Livernois, was 37
2 CONC . [She was born 6 months after the death of her father].
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Francois Casavant on 7 February 1780, in Saint-Charles, Montreal, Quebec, British North America. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 25 September 1820, in Saint-Mathieu-de-Beloeil, La Vallée-du-Richelieu, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 67, and was buried in Saint-Mathieu-de-Beloeil, La Vallée-du-Richelieu, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT ----------------------------------------------
