1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LZ6M-66H
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Catherine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Catherine Meloche was born on 21 March 1774, in Québec, Canada, New France, her father, Antoine Jean Meloche, was 29 and her mother, Marie Louisa Campeau, was 21. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Louis Drouillard on 9 January 1792, in L'Assomption, Essex, Canada West, British North America. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 16 June 1814, in Sandwich, Essex, Upper Canada, British North America, at the age of 40, and was buried in Assumption Cemetery, Windsor, Essex, Ontario, Canada.
