1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L7K3-W4B
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jacques'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jacques Messier was born on 3 February 1748, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, his father, Joseph Messier, was 29 and his mother, Marie-Anne Godu, was 21. 
2 CONT [Note this brother's name was Jacques, not Joseph Jacques. He had an older brother Joseph 1746-1805; they were two separate brothers].
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Antoinette Provost on 24 September 1770, in Sainte-Anne-de-Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 9 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT Joseph Messier 1772–1822
2 CONT Jacques Messier 1773–1817
2 CONT Louis Messier 1775–1842
2 CONT Pierre Messier 1777–1819
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Messier 1779–1833
2 CONT Augustin Messier 1781–1851
2 CONT Augustin Messier 1781–1851
2 CONT François Messier 1783–1862
2 CONT Marie Messier 1784–1848
2 CONT Charles Messier 1787–1854
2 CONT Marie Anne Messier 1790–1869
2 CONT Marie Apolline Messier 1793–1879
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 10 September 1807, in his hometown, at the age of 59, and was buried in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada.
