1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/G9NM-GS4
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph Amable
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Amable Brodeur dit Lavigne was born on 12 April 1774, in Varennes, Montreal, Quebec, British North America. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Josephe Charlotte Lacoste Languedoc on 5 October 1795, in Sainte-Anne-de-Varennes, Surrey, Lower Canada, British North America. They were the parents of at least 14 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 2 December 1818, in Varennes, Surrey, Lower Canada, British North America, at the age of 44, and was buried in Sainte-Anne-de-Varennes, Verchères, Lower Canada, British North America.
