2 CONT
2 CONT When Hippolyte Brodeur was born on 28 March 1786, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, his father, Joseph Amable Brodeur, was 40 and his mother, Marie Louise Marguerite Ayet Malo, was 31. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Josephe Louise Fontaine Bienvenu on 28 January 1811, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 20 August 1860, in Sherbrooke, Sherbrooke, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 74, and was buried in Saint-Michel, Sherbrooke, Quebec, Canada.
