1 NAME Marie Anne Euphrosine Baille /Tetreault dit Ducharme/
2 GIVN Marie Anne Euphrosine Baille
2 SURN Tetreault dit Ducharme
2 _MARNM Baudry
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 11 JAN 1794
2 PLAC St. Matthias Sur Richelieu, Québec, Canada.
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 30 NOV 1868
2 PLAC Benson, Rutland Co., VT 
2 ADDR
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~hagueny/delarm/family_jean_baptisite_beaudry.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Beaudry March 25, 1786 - March 03, 1848 (Jean Baptiste Beaudry + Marie Anne Tetreault dit Ducharme)
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Euphrosine Baille January 11, 1794 - November 30, 1868 ( Pierre Baille dit Printemps + Marie Anne Dufault dit Raclos) Jean Baptiste (John) Beaudry was born in St. Charles Sur Richelieu, Québec, Canada. Marie Euphrosine (Mary
2 CONC ) was born in St. Matthias Sur Richelieu, Québec, Canada. Mary died in Benson, Rutland Co., VT while staying with her son, Charles, and his family. They are buried in the McCaughin Cemetery on McDougal Dr. which is near the origin
2 CONC al location of the Catholic Church in Ticonderoga, NY.
2 CONT
2 CONT John and Mary were married on September 17, 1811 in Ste Marie de Monnoir, Marieville, Québec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT (Sept. 17, 1811 part b) They ran a small bakery and restaurant while they lived near Marieville Québec. They did their best business during the apple harvest for their home was then crowded with apple buyers all day and all night 
2 CONC long. The buyers loved to gamble at cards, generally the game of Loo. Gambling went on all day and night on Sundays, except during religious services. Jean and Marie were prominent and devoted members of the Church. Jean and two s
2 CONC ons, Charles and Louis, served in the choir. (From the notes of Richard D. Wormwood - he indicates the source for this is The Spiritual Struggle of a Roman Catholic, by Louis N. Beaudry).
2 CONT
2 CONT The Beaudry family moved to Hague, Warren Co., NY before 1848 and lived there until after 1865.
2 CONT
2 CONT John and Mary had 15 children
2 CONT
2 CONT http://gw.geneanet.org/famillearbour?lang=fr;p=elie;n=beaudry
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.isalpi.com/webtrees/individual.php?pid=I7497&ged=beaudry022011.ged
