2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Louise'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Louise Racette was born on 9 August 1770, in Saint-Charles-sur-Richelieu, La Vallée-du-Richelieu, Quebec, Canada, her father, Louis Racet, was 23 and her mother, Victoire Tetreau, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Basile Morier on 19 July 1790, in Beloeil, Verchères, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 9 November 1823, in Saint-Hilaire, Rouville, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 53.
