2 CONT Brief Life History of Francois
2 CONT
2 CONT When Francois Casavant II was born on 23 January 1791, in Beloeil, La Vallée-du-Richelieu, Quebec, Canada, his father, Francois Casavant, was 38 and his mother, Marie Marguerite Tetreau, was 38. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Charlotte Janotte-Lachapelle on 15 October 1810, in Saint-Marc-sur-Richelieu, Pierre-De Saurel, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Saint-Pie, Bagot, Quebec, Canada in 1871. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 11 July 1874, in Saint-Jean-Baptiste, Rouville, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 83, and was buried in Saint-Jean-Baptiste, La Vallée-du-Richelieu, Quebec, Canada.
