2 CONT <p>&nbsp;</p><p><p>Hi Robin ,</p></p><p><p>From the 1890 Swedish Census for Kopparberg county on the fee-based Arkion site :</p></p><p><p>http://www.arkion. se </p></p><p><p>Homeparish: Stora Tuna </p></p><p><p>Residence: Domnarfv
2 CONC ets sågverk och Sömfabrik</p></p><p><p>County : Kopparbergs</p></p><p><p>SVARvolume: 000357 Card nr: 10</p></p><p><p>Page : 205 Row : 48</p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p>
2 CONC </p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p>Stora Tuna parish from the census of 1890 in Sweden.</p></p><p><p>Hemort: Domnarfvets sågverk och Sömfabrik (their father worked for a saw mill and he was a filer.)</p></p><p><p>Län: Kopparbergs</p></p>
2 CONC <p><p>Henrik Tallberg f. 1854, Filare and widow (above)</p></p><p><p>Carl Emil f. 1877</p></p><p><p>Elin Henrika f. 1883</p></p><p><p>Einar Martin f. 1887</p></p><p><p>Henrik Emanuel f. 1888</p></p><p><p>Fam nr: 2</p></p><p><p>Joh
2 CONC anna Wilhelmina Johansson f. 1863, maid</p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p>The family members were born in Garpenberg parish.</p></p><p><p>I couldn't find them in the census of 1900.</p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p>He and Martin came over on a
2 CONC  norweian ship “Pestalosi”</p></p><p><p></p></p><p><p>Church called Fadernas Kyrka where harrys dad, Mom brothers and sister are buried-cource ed tallberg</p></p><p><p></p></p><p>2nd wife-Kerstin Nilsdotter-mom to Nils and Elin He
2 CONC nricka</p>
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
