2 CONT When Eléonore Lenora Tétreau was born on March 20, 1809, in Rouville, Canada, her mother, Marguerite, was 25. She married Basile Boswell Du'Fresne Ash and they had 15 children together. She also had one child from another relation
2 CONC ship. She died on May 18, 1892, in Charlotte, Vermont, having lived a long life of 83 years.
