1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/2ZV5-P1Y
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph
2 CONT '''
2 CONT When Joseph Messier was born on 24 January 1772, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jacques Messier, was 23 and his mother, Marie Antoinette Provost, was 21. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Charlotte Ledoux on 23 September 1799, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 26 October 1822, in Marieville, Rouville, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 50, and was buried in Marieville, Rouville, Quebec, Canada.
