1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/2ZV5-576
2 CONT Brief Life History of Louis
2 CONT
2 CONT When Louis Messier was born in 1775, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jacques Messier, was 27 and his mother, Marie Antoinette Provost, was 25. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Charlotte Provost Prevost on 13 February 1804, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Markie Charlotte, he married 2nd wife Marie Josephe Louise Charbonneau
2 CONT (1787–1815) on 25 June 1810 in Varennes, Verchères, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT They had 4 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 12 March 1842, in his hometown, at the age of 67.
