1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L5Z3-SVG
2 CONT Brief Life History of Amable'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Amable Brodeur dit Lavigne was born on 16 October 1798, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, his father, Joseph Amable Brodeur dit Lavigne, was 24 and his mother, Marie Josephe Charlotte Lacoste Languedoc, was 19. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Louise Provost Prevost on 20 October 1818, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Canada East, British North America in 1851. He died on 2 May 1871, in Saint-Jean-Baptiste-de-L'Isle-Verte, Témiscouata, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 72.
