2 CONT
2 CONT He married Esther Ayet Malo on 8 February 1848, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 30 October 1898, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 80.
