1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LKSN-SW3
2 CONT Brief Life History of Louis Basile'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Louis Basile Morier was born on 2 June 1791, in Beloeil, Verchères, Quebec, Canada, his father, Basile Morier, was 25 and his mother, Marie Louise Racette, was 20. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Josephte Gregoire Dufils on 10 February 1817, in Saint-Hilaire, Rouville, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 10 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Saint-Laurent, Montreal, Quebec, Canada in 1861.
