1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L2PM-Y69
2 CONT Brief Life History of Francois'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Francois Casavant III was born on 30 June 1817, in Saint-Jean-Baptiste, Rouville, Quebec, Canada, his father, Francois Casavant, was 26 and his mother, Charlotte Janotte-Lachapelle, was 26. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Genevieve Ruel on 28 August 1837, in Saint-Césaire, Rouville, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 1 daughter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Shefford, Quebec, Canada for about 10 years.
