2 CONT Brief Life History of Sally'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Salomee "Sally" Normandin dit Lamonday was born in 1836, in New York, United States, her father, Claude Normandin dit LaMonday, was 62 and her mother, Louise Guyon, was 36. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pierre "Peter" Boucher in 1870, in Plattsburgh, Clinton, New York, United States. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 9 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived in Schuyler Falls, Clinton, New York, United States in 1860 and Plattsburgh, Clinton, New York, United States for about 10 years.
