1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Amable Nault was born on 17 Aug 1798 at Berthier, Quebec (CWLR, page 313). He married
2 CONT Josephte Lagimoniere, daughter of Jean Baptiste Lagimoniere and Marie Anne Gaboury, circa
2 CONT 1823 at St. Boniface, (Manitoba). He immigrated in 1825 to Red River, (Manitoba) (MBS, C-
2 CONT 14931). As of 1827, he was also known as Neau (1827C, page 5). He died on 4 Feb 1867 at St.
2 CONT Pierre, Manitoba, at age 68 (CWLR, page 313) (SB-Rozyk, page 77, S-3). He was buried on 7 Feb
2 CONT 1867 at St. Boniface, (Manitoba), S-3, Amable Nault (a native of Berthier, Quebec), died 4 Feb
2 CONT 1867 (en hiverement) age 70 years, buried 7 Feb 1867, Witnesses: J. B. Thibault, ptre (signed), G.
2 CONT Dugast, ptre (signed), J. M. Lefloch, ptre (signed), Allard, ptre (signed), Alex eveque de Saint
2 CONT Boniface. (page 77) (ibid).
