1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LHKH-1P2
2 CONT Brief Life History of Josephte'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Josephte Meunier dit Lapierre was born on 10 January 1817, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, her father, Augustin Meunier dit Lapierre, was 28 and her mother, Marie Josephe Bussière, was 22. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Baptiste Raymond on 9 February 1836, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived in Verchères, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada in 1817. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 23 January 1889, in Saint-Hugues, Bagot, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 72.
