1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Athanase_David
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis-Athanase David (June 24, 1882 – January 26, 1953) was a Canadian lawyer, politician, and businessman. He was a cabinet minister in the Provincial Parliament of Quebec, representing the riding of Terrebonne and serving as Pro
2 CONC vincial Secretary. He was later a member of the Canadian Senate.
