2 CONT
2 CONT Baptism record no. 10 Ste-Anne-de-Varennes, p191/211 1810-1819 attached. Godfather Hypolite Jodoin, Godmother Thérese Géoffrion.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date of marriage possibly recorded as 1858 by me from Blue Drouin, but it could be in error there. Marriage record m10 Ste-Famille 1843-1854, p139/308, attached, confirming 1848.
2 CONT
2 CONT Name spelled Mézier in Blue Drouin. This is a common spelling from a transcription when the script for double-esses is a character similar to an f followed by an s. It gives the appearance of a script z. Both Lussier and Messier h
2 CONC ave the same appearance.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1871 Canada Census, St-Jean-Chrysostôme, Châteauguay, Quebec, Canada
