2 CONT --Francois was counted in a census on 07 July 1870 at Plattsburgh, Clinton, New York.
2 CONT
2 CONT --Francois was counted in a census on 02 June 1880 at 29 Court Steet. Plattsburgh, Clinton, New York.
2 CONT
2 CONT --Francois immigrated in 1930 from Canada to the United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT --The Plattsburgh Sentinel
2 CONT
2 CONT In Plattsburgh, Jan. 13, 1894 F. X. Boussy, in the 74th year of his age.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Boussy was for many years a resident of Plattsburgh.  He was born in the city of Montreal, April 18, 1820, came to Plattsburgh in 1830.  He leaves a widow and six children, F. X. Boussy and G. D. of Springfield, Mass., Peter b
2 CONC oussy of Cohoes, Moses boussy of Plattsburgh, and Mrs Fountain of Springfield.  The funeral was held Monday morning at nine o'clock from St. Peter's Church.
