1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LH1P-K89
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jacques Adolphe'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jacques Adolphe Jodouin VII was born on 13 November 1820, in Sainte-Anne-de-Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jacques Jodoin, was 25 and his mother, Marie Anathalie Bordua, was 18. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife Emélie Frechette (1823-1853) on 5 October 1841, in Saint-Damase, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Marie Eudoce Laurence (1823– )
2 CONT on 27 February 1854 in Saint-Damase, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada
2 CONT They had at least 4 children
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Saint-Damase, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada for about 30 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT
