2 CONT Brief Life History of Calixte'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Calixte Casavant was born on 15 February 1845, in Saint-Césaire, Rouville, Quebec, Canada, his father, Francois Casavant, was 27 and his mother, Genevieve Ruel, was 31. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elize Chauvin on 10 January 1865, in Bonsecours, Le Val-Saint-François, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. He lived in Shefford, Quebec, Canada for about 40 years.
