2 CONT Brief Life History of Marguerite'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marguerite Gratton was born about 1832, in Quebec, Canada, her father, Joseph Eustache Gratton, was 42 and her mother, Sophie Boisvert, was 35. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Roch Terrien on 10 October 1854, in Saint-Louis-de-Terrebonne, Terrebonne, Les Moulins, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived in Argenteuil, Quebec, Canada in 1881. She died on 27 September 1888, in Saint-Jovite, Terrebonne, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 57, and was buried in Saint-Jovite, Terrebonne, Quebec, Canada.
