1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth was born Elizabeth D'Aigle in 1843, the daughter of Touissant D'Aigle and Amelia Bouley.  After Touissant died in 1849, Amelia married a second time.  Her second husband was Paul LaRose.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married Francis Duchene around 1862 and had one son, Frank.  A few years later, Francis died.  Elizabeth married a second time in 1869.  Her second husband was a widower named George McClure.  He brought children into th
2 CONC e marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT It eventually became "Yours, Mine, and Ours."  George and Elizabeth had at least five children together: Ella, Richard, Lottie, Jimmy, and Mae.  Charlotte "Lottie" McClure (1878-1951) married James McGrath in February 1903.    
