1 NOTE {geni:about_me} in the 1850 census at Chateaugay age 7
2 CONT
2 CONT 1854 moved to Wisconsin
2 CONT
2 CONT in the 1860 census at Fond Du Lac
2 CONT
2 CONT enlisted in the Civil War on august 15 1862 at age 19 in Munfresboro, Co. A, 21st Regiment, Infantry.
2 CONT
2 CONT discharged March 3 1863 in Munfresboro, TN as a Private.
2 CONT
2 CONT Re-enlisted in the Civil War Co a. 2nd Regiment Calvary on September 3 1864.
2 CONT
2 CONT Discharged on June 12 1865 in Memphis, TN
2 CONT
2 CONT in the 1880 census at Maple Creek at age 36 with children Emory, Benjamin, Abraham and Joda (Joseph).
2 CONT
2 CONT Still living in Maple Creek in 1890 and 1895.
2 CONT
2 CONT in the 1919 census at Clintonville
2 CONT
2 CONT living in Oshkosh in 1914.
2 CONT
2 CONT Always signed his name with an "X" which suggests he was illiterate.
2 CONT
2 CONT His war records indicate he had no middle name.
