1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/2WFL-6S4
2 CONT Brief Life History of Josephine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Josephine Boucher was born on 8 July 1857, in New York County, New York, United States, her father, Pierre "Peter" Bushey, was 24 and her mother, Salomee "Sally" Normandin dit Lamonday, was 21. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Patenaude on 7 October 1876, in Grand Isle, Vermont, United States. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 10 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived in United States in 1900 and Grand Isle, Grand Isle, Vermont, United States in 1910. She died on 27 May 1936, in Grand Isle, Vermont, United States, at the age of 78.
2 CONT
