1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Church of marriage was listed on records as St. Simon Ymaske.  However, when we personally explored the region we found that the entire region around the Ymaska River was previously called Ymaske.  The church of St. Simon de Bagot
2 CONC  is located closer to Montreal, just east of Ste. Hyacinthe, off Route 20. July 2002--Information obtained from City of Manchester records associated with Yvonne's marriage certificate indicates that Didyme was a Baker.
2 CONT
