1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Added June 5, 2016 by William Arthur Allen: One of the sad outcomes of the Louis Riel story and the Northwest Rebellion was the introduction of the "Pass System" limiting the movement of people away from their home
2 CONC  communities. This dark chapter in Canadian history is a revelation that a democratic government can sometimes make policy that is contrary to its own democratic foundations, a breach of commitments made by the government in treat
2 CONC y agreements, and an act of blatant racism against its own citizens. The story has been told recently at http://www.cbc.ca/radio/unreserved/exploring-the-past-present-and-future-of-life-in-indigenous-canada-1.3336594/the-pass-syst
2 CONC em-another-dark-secret-in-canadian-history-1.3338520
2 CONT
2 CONT Living descendant https://www.geni.com/people/Jay-Barker-Giniw-Ogichidaa/6000000082324563865?through=6000000082324660852, registered member of The Turtle Mountain Band of Chippewa Indians. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.collectionscanada.gc.ca/obj/008004/f2/H-50_en.pdf]
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.alittlehistory.com/Mtfullst.htm]
