2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre Raymond was born in 1854 as the son of Jean B. and Joseffette. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Valida Jacques Raymond on 26 December 1878, in Ware, Hampshire, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 7 sons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Saint-Hugues, Bagot, Quebec, Canada in 1871 and Assiniboia East, Regina, Saskatchewan, Canada in 1906. He died on 27 November 1940, in Storthoaks, Storthoaks No. 31, Saskatchewan, Canada, at the age of 86.
