1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.murphyfuneralhome.ca/book-of-memories/63216/Meilleur-Ernest-Francois/obituary.php
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.obitsforlife.com/obituary/216179/Meilleur-Ernest-Francois.php
2 CONT
2 CONT Peacefully at Nipissing Manor, Corbeil, Ontario on Wednesday June 8, 2005 in his 89TH year. Ernest Meilleur, formerly of Rapides des Joachims P.Q., son of the late Hector and Marie Louise (nee Chass) Meilleur. Dear brother of Oliv
2 CONC e Therrien (late Roger), Bowmanville and Rita Coote (Edgar), Deep River. Predeceased by his brothers Christie, Gerard, Bill, Maurice, Joseph and Alfred Meilleur and sisters Vien Dandeneau, Virginia Pilon, Marie Louise Boss, Paulin
2 CONC e Carey and Gabrielle Vaughan. Dear uncle to many nieces and nephews. Relatives and Friends may call at the VALLEY FUNERAL HOME, Hwy. 17, Deep River on Friday 2 - 4 and 7 - 9 p.m. and on Saturday after 12 noon. A Funeral Mass will
2 CONC  be celebrated on Saturday afternoon June 11TH at 2 o'clock in St. Anne's Catholic Church, Rapides des Joachims, P.Q. Interment St. Anne's Cemetery. In memory of Ernest, donations to the Ottawa Heart Institute would be appreciated
2 CONC  by the family. Arrangements in care of the MURPHY FUNERAL HOME, Pembroke.
