2 DATE 12 MAY 1925
1 DEAT
2 DATE 10 OCT 2011
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.valleyfuneralhome.ca/obits/obituary.php?id=117846
2 CONT
2 CONT At the Deep River and District Hospital on Monday, October 10, 2011. Rita Coote, daughter of the late Hector and Marie Louise Meilleur. Beloved  wife of Edgar Coote of Deep River and the late Carl Gutzman (by 1st marriage). Loving
2 CONC  mother of Steven Gutzman and his wife Phyllis of Deep River, Wayne Gutzman of Toronto, Yvonne Beckett and her husband Keith of Kamloops, B.C., and Karl Gutzman of Golden, B.C. Cherished grandmother of 11 grandchildren and 15 grea
2 CONC t-grandchildren. Predeceased by a son Donald Reid Gutzman, 7 brothers and 6 sisters.  Friends may call at the Valley Funeral Home, Deep River on Wednesday from 2-4 and 7-9 p.m. and on Thursday from  9:30 to 10:30 a.m. Funeral Serv
2 CONC ice to be conducted in Faith Lutheran Church, Deep River on Thursday at 11:00 a.m. Followed by cremation. Interment of cremated remains will  be in Trinity Lutheran Cemetery, Chalk River on Saturday, October 15 at 11:00 a.m. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In memoriam donations to the Canadian Cancer Society would be gratefully appreciated. 
